{"ID":"20240205170449-287t4ny","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205170449-287t4ny","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170449-287t4ny\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135706-j8nrs1o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170553-jjjrb06\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135706-j8nrs1o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:85,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:85\u0026#125;","title":"炉甘石","type":"doc","updated":"20240902102039"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135706-j8nrs1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135706-j8nrs1o","updated":"20240206135716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、广西、湖南等地。\n【性状】\t本品性状为块状集合体，呈不规则的块状，灰白色或淡红色。表面粉性无光泽，凹凸不平，多孔，似蜂窝状。体轻，易碎。无臭，味微涩。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t解毒明目退翳，收湿止痒敛疮。用于目赤肿痛，眼缘赤烂，翳膜胬肉，溃疡不敛，脓水淋漓，湿疮，皮肤瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135707-xb5vxdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135707-xb5vxdf","updated":"20240206135707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135707-lqp5h8f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205170553-jjjrb06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170553-jjjrb06","updated":"20240205170553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炉甘石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炉甘石-20240205170553-9zhkfgr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716163821-tf9276z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716163821-tf9276z","updated":"20240717080512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛蒡子 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛蒡子 8-20240717080507-qs7bqn1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716160843-2dqqy4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716160843-2dqqy4f","updated":"20240717080521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 575px;","style":"width: 565px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炉甘石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炉甘石-20240716163546-einj4sv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 565px;\" parent-style=\"width: 575px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716160913-xnh5hi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716160913-xnh5hi3","updated":"20240717080528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 381px;","style":"width: 371px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炉甘石 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炉甘石 1-20240716163627-2xi08fb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 371px;\" parent-style=\"width: 381px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炉甘石 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炉甘石 2-20240716164125-l3a3xea.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716164257-xz0khgt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716164257-xz0khgt","updated":"20240717080536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 615px;","style":"width: 605px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炉甘石 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炉甘石 3-20240716164257-hnxayx4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 605px;\" parent-style=\"width: 615px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"炉甘石 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/炉甘石 4-20240716174223-rlpgtt8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716160348-9eyk64a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716160348-9eyk64a","updated":"20240716160416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：炉甘石为碳酸盐类矿物方解石族菱锌矿，主含碳酸锌。"}]},{"ID":"20240716160349-n9vfvuy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240716160349-n9vfvuy"}},{"ID":"20240902102032-i9albxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-i9albxi","updated":"20240902102039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：炉甘石"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-hqy0sd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-hqy0sd2","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炉甘石《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-1k0fay9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-1k0fay9","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】LúGānShí"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-q1m00i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-q1m00i7","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】GALAMINA"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-k8b2876","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-k8b2876","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】甘石、浮水甘石"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-7vcljt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-7vcljt1","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为碳酸盐类矿物方解石族菱锌矿，主含碳酸锌（ZnCO3）。采挖后，洗净，晒干，除去杂石。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-qty45op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-qty45op","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为块状集合体，呈不规则的块状，灰白色或淡红色。表面粉性，无光泽，凹凸不平，多孔，似蜂窝状。体轻，易碎。无臭，味微涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-1si0wvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-1si0wvf","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-yuq6lzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-yuq6lzf","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）取本品粗粉1g，加稀盐酸10ml，即泡沸。将此气体通入氢氧化钙试液中，即生成白色沉淀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-fw92ytr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-fw92ytr","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粗粉1g，加稀盐酸10ml使溶解，滤过，滤液加亚铁氰化钾试液，即生成白色沉淀，或杂有微量的蓝色沉淀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-k87u02c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-k87u02c","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-0i7613b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-0i7613b","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炉甘石：除去杂质，打碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-sb0kmvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-sb0kmvq","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煅炉甘石：取净炉甘石，照明煅法（附录ⅡD）煅至红透，再照水飞法（附录ⅡD）水飞，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-36031zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-36031zk","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-19mxupn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-19mxupn","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-bab7clp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-bab7clp","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解毒明目退翳，收湿止痒敛疮。用于目赤肿痛，眼缘赤烂，翳膜胬肉，溃疡不敛，脓水淋漓，湿疮，皮肤瘙痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-c5esa0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-c5esa0k","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】不作内服，外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-pspj66n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-pspj66n","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-e8gzefo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-e8gzefo","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-4tw87yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-4tw87yi","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炉甘石《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-06jojyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-06jojyb","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《外丹本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-w3c5fq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-w3c5fq0","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】LúGānShí"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-11midw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-11midw6","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】甘石（《品汇精要》），卢甘石（《医学入门》），羊肝石（《现代实用中药》），浮水甘石（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-o4ddpo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-o4ddpo8","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为碳酸盐类矿物菱锌矿的矿石。采得后，除去杂石、泥土。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-46r51f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-46r51f0","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-4ysgk8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-4ysgk8i","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"菱锌矿（《石雅》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-knpw83n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-knpw83n","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三方晶系。晶形呈菱面体，但少见。一般多为土块状、钟乳状、多孔块状等。颜色因杂质而不同，纯净者为白色，含铅者为深绿色，含镉者为黄色，含铁者呈褐色。条痕为白色。玻璃光泽，半透明至不透明。解理依菱面，成107°之斜角，仅显晶集合体始有之.断口参差状。硬度5。比重4.1～4.5。性脆。常见于闪锌矿氧化带中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-6g9wucu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-6g9wucu","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】产于广西、四川、云南、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-8pvzw2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-8pvzw2q","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】为不规则的块状，扁平形戌圆形，大小不一，表面白色或淡红色，有凹陷或小孔洞，显粉性。体轻而质松，易碎，断面白色咸淡红色，呈颗粒状，并有细小孔隙，有吸湿性。气无，味微涩。火煅后即成白色或淡黄色的无晶结块或细致粉末。以块大、白色或显淡红色、质轻者为佳。不熔融。在木炭上烧之则生氧化锌之薄膜，热时黄色、冷后则变为白色。热稀盐酸能使其溶解并产生泡沫。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-kmhtb8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-kmhtb8i","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-r22ma0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-r22ma0o","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要成分为碳酸锌，尚含少量氧化钙0.27％，氧化镁0.45％，氧化铁0.58％，氧化锰0.01％。此石中的锌，往往为少量的铁（二价）所取代。另外，有的炉甘石品种尚含少量钻、铜、镉、铅和痕量的锗与铟。青岛和济南的炉甘石，主要成分为碳酸锌，并含少量铁、铝、钙、镁等杂质及极微量的钠。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-134lpar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-134lpar","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煅炉甘石，主要成分为氧化锌。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-0q5oxk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-0q5oxk6","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】为不溶于水的天然碳酸锌，广用于皮肤科，作为中度的防腐、收敛、保护剂治疗皮肤炎症或表面刨伤。一般用5～10％水混悬液（洗剂），亦有用油膏者。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-pz4z8nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-pz4z8nn","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-xa0k3pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-xa0k3pp","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炉甘石：拣去杂质，打碎。煅甘石：取净炉甘石，打碎，置坩埚内，在无烟的炉火中煅烧至微红，取出，立即倒入水盆中浸淬，搅拌，倾出混悬液，将石渣晾干，再煅烧3～4次，最后将石渣弃去。取混悬液澄清，倾去清水，将滤出的细粉干燥.黄连水拌甘石：取黄连煎汤，加入上述煅甘石细粉，拌匀并使吸尽，烘干。（每煅甘石细粉100斤，用黄连12斤8两）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-fptbsu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-fptbsu9","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《医学入门》：\"炉甘石，用砂罐一盛一盖，于炭火中煅令通赤，以童便或黄连水淬之，再煅再淬，九次，细研水飞过用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-d7067pv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-d7067pv","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-mfsuz9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-mfsuz9t","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-fyv7dua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-fyv7dua","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"味甘，性平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-i7z60n0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-i7z60n0","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"甘，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-nj0p67q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-nj0p67q","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-ubcl18i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-ubcl18i","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝、脾、肺经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-btefutf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-btefutf","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-lizvh2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-lizvh2k","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《玉楸药解》：\"入手太阴肺。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-8qc3244","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-8qc3244","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入肝、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-058txil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-058txil","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-k9uxdvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-k9uxdvg","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去翳退赤，收温敛疮。治目赤翳障，烂弦风眼，溃疡不敛，皮肤湿疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-sbjsk67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-sbjsk67","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"主风热赤眼，或痒或痛，渐生翳膜，及治下部湿疮，调敷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-cb8tt02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-cb8tt02","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"止血，消肿毒，生肌，明目，去翳退赤，收湿除烂。同龙脑点治目中一切诸病。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-wr0jlis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-wr0jlis","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"点眼皮湿烂及阴囊湿肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-vzyf1dn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-vzyf1dn","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《玉楸药解》：\"医痔瘘下疳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-6d1hl7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-6d1hl7a","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《现代实用中药》：\"用于慢性溃疡、下腿溃疡之不易收口者，有防腐生肌之功。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-e1jten1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-e1jten1","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】外用：水飞点眼，研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-16mtuj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-16mtuj0","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-huziibv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-huziibv","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治目暴赤肿：炉甘石（火煅，尿淬）、风化消，等分。为末。新水化一粟点之。（《御药院方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-4o9j7yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-4o9j7yi","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治诸般翳膜：炉甘石、青矾、朴硝，等分。为末。每用一字，沸汤化开，温洗，日三次。（《宣明论方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-6nx3vlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-6nx3vlm","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治风眼流泪烂弦：炉甘石二两，以黄连一两煎水，入童尿半盏，再熬，下朴消一两，又熬，成，以火煅石淬七次，洗净，为末，入密陀僧末一两，研匀，收点之。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-hq693hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-hq693hy","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治各种睑缘炎：十大功劳根茎五十克，加水五百毫升，煎成浓汁，去渣后加炉甘石粉成为浓糊状，干燥成为散剂。然后取此散剂三十克，加凡士林六十克，羊毛脂十克，调匀成眼膏。涂于睑缘，每日两次。（遵义《新医药资料》（6）：85，1970）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-pyvu1de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-pyvu1de","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治目暗昏花：炉甘石（火煅，童尿淬七次）、代赭石（火煅，醋淬七次）、黄丹（水飞）各四两。为末。白沙蜜半斤，以铜铛炼去白沫，更添清水五、六碗，熬沸下药，文武火熬至一碗，滴水不散，以夹纸滤入瓷器收之。频点目用。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-38s0cf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-38s0cf5","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治下部阴疮：炉甘石（火煅，醋淬五次）一两，孩儿茶三钱。为末，麻油调敷。（《秘传经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-t2izjig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-t2izjig","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治漏疮不合：童尿制炉甘石、牡蛎粉。外塞之。内服滋补药。（《杂病治例》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-389krem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-389krem","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治阴汗湿痒：炉甘石一分，真蚌粉半分。研粉扑之。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-knb2czk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-knb2czk","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治聤耳出脓及黄汁：炉甘石（研）二钱，枯矾二钱，胭脂半钱，麝香少许。上为细末。用绵子缠缴耳中脓汁尽，别用绵子蘸药，或干吹少许入耳亦可。如积热上壅，耳出脓水，神芎丸百粒，泻三、五行。（《医方大成论》红绵散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-n5r9ee4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-n5r9ee4","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治齿疏陷物：炉甘石（煅）、寒水石等分。为末。每用少许擦牙，忌用刷牙，久久自密。（《集玄方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-ecpvla4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-ecpvla4","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-wiq0r3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-wiq0r3o","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"炉甘石，阳明经药也，治目病为要药。时珍常用炉甘石（煅，淬）、海螵蛸、硼砂各一两，为细末，以点诸目病甚妙.入朱砂五钱，则性不帖也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-ddludmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-ddludmf","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《玉楸药解》：\"炉甘石生金银矿，秉寒肃燥敛之气，最能收湿合疮，退翳除烂。但病重根深，不能点洗收效，必须服药饵，用拔本塞源之法。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-gmuor0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-gmuor0o","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-24etznh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-24etznh","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炉甘石《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-l12jnlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-l12jnlj","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《外丹本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-xpmzgpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-xpmzgpp","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】LúGānShí"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-bfccnvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-bfccnvr","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Calamine"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-47rsa8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-47rsa8c","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】甘石、卢甘石、芦甘石、羊肝石、浮水甘石、炉眼石、干石"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-8pel0y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-8pel0y5","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-g08k3uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-g08k3uu","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为碳酸盐类矿物菱锌矿的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-seqxuhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-seqxuhv","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Smithsonite;Hydrozincite"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-5d5kdlw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-5d5kdlw","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：采得后，除去杂石、泥土。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-r7r9ktb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-r7r9ktb","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-392ul5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-392ul5y","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.菱锌矿晶体结构属三方晶系。单个晶体呈菱面体或复三方偏三角面体，但极少见。常呈钟乳状、块状、土状、皮壳状集合体。纯者白色，常被染成灰白、淡黄、浅绿或浅褐色。透明至半透明，玻璃光泽或暗淡土状光泽，晶面上有时呈珍珠光泽。硬度4.5-5，性脆，断口参差状。相对密度4-4.5。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-vwua879","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-vwua879","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.呈块状、土状、多孔至致密状、皮壳状、具细纤维构造的同心带状。白色至灰黄、褐紫、浅紫色。土状光泽，亦呈绢丝光泽。硬度4，相对密度3.5-3.8。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-5i1sdzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-5i1sdzt","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-swi1pk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-swi1pk3","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.产于原生铅锌矿床氧化带。主要由闪锌矿氧化分解产生易溶的硫酸锌，交代碳酸盐围岩或原生矿石中的方解石而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-k187ba6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-k187ba6","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.产于矿床的氧化带中，为次生矿物。主要由闪锌矿蚀变而成。与菱锌矿共生。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-8h6lh0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-8h6lh0n","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：两者均产于湖南、广西四川、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-4agq6ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-4agq6ck","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】天然矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-z8cepqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-z8cepqy","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-ehmsyu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-ehmsyu7","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别(1)生甘石（菱锌矿）为块状或钟乳状集合体。呈不规则块状。白色，灰白色或浅土黄色，条痕灰白色至淡棕色。表面有的有凹陷或多孔隙，似蜂窝状。土状光泽，不透明，体轻，质较硬而脆，易碎，断面白色或浅土黄色，有的黄白相间似花纹状。无臭、味微涩。(2)浮水甘石（水锌矿）多为白色，孔隙较多。体轻，质松软，有较强吸水性，舐之粘舌。均以色白、体轻、质松者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-d2qghoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-d2qghoj","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别(1)生甘石（菱锌矿）透射偏光镜下：薄片中无色透明，但由于铁质污染，结晶较差些，往往呈褐棕色，结晶体菱面体清楚，粒径一般为0.01mm,粒与粒镶嵌紧密。折射率Ne=1.849,No=1.621;双折射率Ne-No=0.228。干涉色呈高级彩色，较碳酸盐矿更鲜艳；平行消光。一轴晶；负光性。(2)浮水甘石（水锌矿）透射偏光镜下：微带黄色，往往呈环形针状和粒状。针体常沿解理裂隙分布，长0.03mm；粒状菱面体清楚，粒径0.01-0.02mm。折射率Np=1.640,Nm=1.736,Ng=1.750;双折射率Ng-Np=0.110;干涉色鲜艳（较高）；平行消光。二轴晶；正光性。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-kxj3da2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-kxj3da2","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：本品按干燥品计算，含氧化锌(ZnO)不得少于40.0%。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-l4zj0tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-l4zj0tv","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-j4r5yy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-j4r5yy8","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.炉甘石主要成分为碳酸锌(ZnCO3),尚含少量氧化钙(CaO)0.27%,氧化镁(MgO)0.45%,氧化铁(Fe2O3)0.58%，氧化锰(MnO)0.01%。其中锌往往为少量的铁（二价）所取代。有的尚含少量钴、铜、镉、铅和痕量的锗、铟。青岛和济南的炉甘石，并含少量铁、铝、钙、镁等杂质及极微量的钠。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-vaxrq1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-vaxrq1m","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.浮水甘石主要成分为碱式碳酸锌[Zn5(CO3)2·(OH)6]，并含铅、镉、镁、铁、铝等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-jict2zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-jict2zz","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】为不溶于水的天然碳酸锌，广用于皮肤科，作为中度的防腐、收敛、保护剂治疗皮肤炎症或表面创伤。一般用5-10%水混悬液(洗剂)，亦有用油膏者。外用可抑制局部葡萄球菌生长。能部分吸收创面分泌液，有收敛、保护作用；尚能抑制局部葡萄球菌的生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-loucd2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-loucd2e","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-sew5sm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-sew5sm2","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)取本品在紫外光灯(253.7nm)下检视，显浅蓝紫色荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-n089hro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-n089hro","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)取本品粗粉1g，加稀盐酸10ml,即泡沸，将此气体涌入氢氧化钙试液中，即发生折色沉淀。（检查碳酸盐）（3）取本品稀盐酸溶液，滤过，滤液加亚铁氰化钾试液，即发生白色沉淀，或杂有微量蓝色沉淀。（检查锌盐）（4）取本品1小块，置具有圆孔软木塞试管内，灼烧，在管壁有水生成（检查水锌矿）；在管壁无水生成。（检查菱锌矿）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-gyb8k7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-gyb8k7d","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-3jl333n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-3jl333n","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.炉甘石，用砂罐一盛一盖，于炭火中煅令通赤，以童便或黄连水淬之，再煅再淬，九次，细研水飞过用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-g4z9ee6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-g4z9ee6","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.黄连菊花煅甘石：取炉甘石装砂嘟噜内，煅至红透取出，趁热倾入水盆内、待晾后捞出晒干研粉；再用水飞法取细粉置下药之煎汤内，捣拌均匀，晒干即可。炉甘石1kg，用黄连、菊花各式各120g。薄荷黄连菊花蝉蜕荆芥桑叶防风煅甘石取以下药料加水2桶，共煎过滤，将炉甘石倒入滤液中，不断搅拌，10余天后取沉淀细粉，供药用。每炉甘石5kg，用薄荷250g；黄连、菊花、蝉蜕、荆芥各120g，桑叶60g，防风各60g。四黄栀子煅甘石：取黄连、黄柏、黄芩、大黄、栀子加水煎汤汁备用。另将炉甘石置坩埚内，入炉火中煅至红透，取出立即倒入汁中，待汁被吸尽时出，水飞后干燥。每炉甘石1kg；黄连、黄柏、黄芩、大黄、栀子各6g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-jta0zss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-jta0zss","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.煅甘石：取净炉甘石，打碎，置坩埚内，在无烟的炉火中煅烧至微红，取出，立即倒入水盆中浸淬，搅拌，倾出混悬液，将石渣晾干，再煅烧3-4次，最后将石渣弃去。取混悬液澄清，倾去清水，将滤出的细粉干燥。黄连水拌甘石：取黄连煎汤，加入上述煅甘石细粉，拌匀并使吸尽，烘干。(每煅甘石细粉100斤，用黄连12斤8两)"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-9hhah5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-9hhah5m","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；平；温；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-wavh500","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-wavh500","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；脾；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-43akahz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-43akahz","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】明目去翳；收湿止痒；敛疮生肌。主目赤肿痛；烂弦风眼；多泪怕光；翳膜胬肉；溃疡不敛；皮肤湿疮；阴部湿痒"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-zu61c5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-zu61c5n","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】外用：水飞点眼，研末撒或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-rr3dknn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-rr3dknn","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】忌内服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-j3pfrhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-j3pfrhy","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】治目暴肿方《御药院方》；治风眼流泪烂弦方《卫生简易方》；治目眩昏花方《卫生简易方》；治下疳阴疮方《秘传经验方》；治阴汗湿痒《仁斋直指方》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-i0st0rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-i0st0rl","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-ry3x1qa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-ry3x1qa","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》：炉甘石，阳明经药也，治目病为要药。时珍常用炉甘石(煅，淬)、海螵蛸、硼砂各一两，为细末，以点诸目病甚妙。入朱砂五钱，则性不粘也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-4wngtcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-4wngtcb","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《玉楸药解》：炉甘石生金银矿，秉寒肃燥敛之气，最能收湿合疮，退翳除烂。但病重根深，不能点洗收效，必须服药饵，用拔本塞源之法。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-qxq2tkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-qxq2tkk","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《品汇精要》：主风热赤眼，或痒或痛，渐生翳膜，及治下部湿疮，调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-fyrqlqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-fyrqlqo","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《纲目》：止血，消肿毒，生肌，明目，去翳退赤，收湿除烂。同龙脑点治目中一切诸病。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-13id0ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-13id0ih","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经逢原》：点眼皮湿烂及阴囊湿肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-qb5jp8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-qb5jp8y","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《玉楸药解》：医痔痿下疳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-w3mdg71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-w3mdg71","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《现代实用中药》：用于慢性溃疡、下腿溃疡之不易收口者，有防腐生肌之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102032-s1bgufr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102032-s1bgufr","updated":"20240902102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102033-kv61ph3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902102033-kv61ph3","updated":"20240902102100"}},{"ID":"20240902102034-ypgvilg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102034-ypgvilg","updated":"20240902102100"}}]}